 \, can't-sleep\, reach-for-the-stars\, World Series kind of stuff\,' I've l
 ived a life less Mary-Kate and Ashley\, more misadventures and absurdity. M
 y only claim to fame is a split second in a shampoo ad... so what have I be
 en doing? As a chaos magnet and psychiatrist\, I try to work out what to do
